         BZ    RDBNEDF                                         XA0056DK         
         LTR   R3,R3          NOT OPEN YET?                    XA0056DK         
         BNZ   RDBEDF1                                         XA0056DK         
         LR    R1,R5          THE FST, AS RDB10 GIVES IT       XA0056DK         
         L     R15,AACTFREE                                    XA0056DK         
         BALR  R14,R15                                         XA0056DK         
         LR    R3,R1                                           XA0056DK         
